    <description>Ultimate Settings Panel puts more than 250 Windows settings, administrative tools, diagnostics
and commands into a single searchable window, so you stop hunting through Settings, Control
Panel and half-remembered run commands.

* Search across everything from the top of the window
* Browse by category, and star the entries you use most
* Every card has a Run button that launches the tool directly, and a Copy button for the
  underlying command
* Light and dark themes

Categories cover Windows 11 settings, Windows tools, Control Panel applets, networking,
diagnostics, power and session, server administration, terminal and shell, Outlook and Office,
and browsers.

Portable - a single executable, nothing installed, no administrator rights required. First
released in 2014 and free ever since, with no tiers, no licence fees and no commercial
restriction.

Version 8.0.0 is a full rewrite: a native app rendering the panel in a Microsoft Edge WebView2
window, replacing the older WinForms build.</description>
    <summary>250+ Windows settings, tools and commands in one searchable panel</summary>
